DE:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Sag bloß, du hast die verlorene
Sache noch mal verloren,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Üzgünüm,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bu benim değil,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ama
Dedektif {{TAG:0005:0008:}} işin peşindeyken{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
sahibini çok geçmeden bulursun bence.

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Yaşasın!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Kaybettiğim çizgi roman bu!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bulduğuna çok sevindim!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}"{{TAG:000E:0004:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}
Adam"ın {{TAG:0004:0006:0001}}. sayısı tam koleksiyonluk!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
