IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Uau!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non ci credo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Erano secoli
che non vedevo più questa borsa!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Mi viene quasi da piangere!

{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Mitico!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Hai trovato la mia borsa!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Uffa, ma perché ho sempre la testa
tra le nuvole?!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Oooh!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} You found my mitten!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Excellent!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'd been looking for this
FORever!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yep, this is definitely my mitten.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Now I won't have to wander around
with one cold hand!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pues sí, es mi manopla.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Ahora no tendré que ir
por ahí con una mano fría!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Evviva! Riecco qui il mio guanto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ora non dovrò più andare in giro
con una zampa gelata e una no!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh ja, das ist mein Handschuh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Endlich muss meine linke Hand
nicht mehr frieren!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Evet, bu kesinlikle benim eldivenim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Artık tek elim buz gibi dolaşmak
zorunda kalmayacak!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ma certo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} È proprio il mio guanto!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Profuma ancora delle patatine
fritte che ho mangiato l'ultima
volta che me lo sono messo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

DE:
Ach, dieses alte Ding...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich hatte
einfach keine Lust mehr, mich
damit abzuschleppen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Das hättest du mir echt nicht
hinterhertragen müssen, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ist aber trotzdem nett von dir!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

